@EPMC_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Test 1: Get portfolio for Cambridge with default limits
GET {{EPMC_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio/institution-portfolio?institution=Cambridge
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 2: Get portfolio for Manchester with custom limits
GET {{EPMC_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio/institution-portfolio?institution=Manchester&limit=5&publicationsPerGrant=3
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 3: Get portfolio for Oxford
GET {{EPMC_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio/institution-portfolio?institution=Oxford
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 4: Invalid request - empty institution (should return 400)
GET {{EPMC_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio/institution-portfolio?institution=
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 5: Invalid request - limit exceeds maximum (should return 400)
GET {{EPMC_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio/institution-portfolio?institution=Cambridge&limit=15
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 6: Swagger UI
GET {{EPMC_HostAddress}}/swagger
Accept: text/html

###